  "releaseNotes": "RoomSharp 0.4.4\n            - Fluent Migration DX: Column chaining, convenience methods (Id, Timestamps, SoftDelete), and TypeAffinity alias.\n            - Programmatic Seeding API: db.SeedAsync() for MAUI/mobile apps, SeederOptions, SeederContext builder pattern.\n            - RoomSeeder<TDatabase>: Strongly-typed base class for cleaner seeder implementations.\n            - Security: Fixed SQL injection in SchemaGenerator.TableExists() using parameterized queries.\n            - Stability: Fixed potential deadlock in ObservableQuery.Publish() with DeliveryMode.All.\n            - Fixed compiler warnings CS8509 and CS8601.\n            - Updated CLI make:seeder template with new helper methods.",
